# [BPM](../wg/bpm.html)

## Summary

The BPM (Benchmarking and Performance Measurement) Working Group held its inaugural session at IETF 127. The chairs opened the meeting with operational updates, document status, and an explicit emphasis on prioritizing working group documents that feature active implementations or Hackathon demonstrations.

The session covered updates across multiple active working group documents and individual drafts spanning device power benchmarking, encrypted performance metrics, source address validation benchmarking, hybrid telemetry, STAMP protocol extensions, Segment Routing performance measurement, YANG models for on-path telemetry, Computing-Aware Traffic Steering (CATS) benchmarking, working group transition management, and research collaboration with the proposed NET4AI Research Group.

