### Hybrid Two-Step (HTS) Performance Measurement Method
* **Presentation:** [5. Updates to Hybrid Two-Step](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/127/materials/slides-127-bpm-sessb-updates-to-hybrid-two-step-00)
* **Presenter:** Greg Mirsky
* **Draft:** `draft-ietf-bpm-hybrid-two-step`
* **Details:**
  * Greg Mirsky presented updates addressing reviewer feedback (specifically from Matt Johnston).
  * HTS decouples telemetry generation (via trigger packets) from transport/collection (via follow-up packets) across point-to-point and point-to-multipoint topologies without redundant data replication.
  * Updates clarified architecture, trigger processing for synthetic vs. data packets, follow-up timer expiration logic, HTS collector error codes (requesting an IANA error code registry), and tightened RFC 2119 normative language throughout the operational section.

