### Bootstrapping STAMP Test Session Using MPLS LSP Ping
* **Presentation:** [6. Bootstrapping STAMP Test Session Using MPLS LSP Ping](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/127/materials/slides-127-bpm-sessb-bootstrapping-stamp-test-session-using-mpls-lsp-ping-00)
* **Presenter:** Greg Mirsky
* **Details:**
  * Greg Mirsky introduced a mechanism to bootstrap STAMP test sessions over MPLS LSPs using LSP Ping extensions.
  * Specifies a new STAMP Session Bootstrap TLV carrying the STAMP Session ID and dynamic range UDP port numbers to enhance security.
  * Defines encapsulation rules for IPv4 (127.0.0.0/8 loopback range) and IPv6 (dummy loopback prefix per RFC 9708) to prevent leaking OAM packets outside the intended path in failure scenarios.

