### Update of the STAMP CoS Extension for ECN
* **Presentation:** [7. Update of the STAMP CoS Extension for ECN](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/127/materials/slides-127-bpm-sessb-update-of-the-stamp-cos-extension-for-ecn-01)
* **Presenter:** Mark Smith
* **Draft:** `draft-ietf-bpm-stamp-cos-ecn`
* **Details:**
  * Mark Smith reported revisions incorporating co-authors (Kartik Sundaresan and Will Hawkins, who provided implementation feedback) and addressing TSV-ART review comments.
